1. INTRODUCTION
======================================================================

This Proprietary Software License ("License") governs the source code,
compiled software, executable files, user interface designs, graphics,
branding, documentation, configuration files, scripts, and other
materials associated with Leviathan Launcher ("Leviathan", the
"Launcher", or the "Software").

Leviathan Launcher is an independently developed third-party desktop
launcher intended for use with Minecraft: Java Edition by legitimate
owners of the game.

Unless explicitly stated otherwise in writing by the copyright holder,
Leviathan Launcher is proprietary software and is NOT open-source
software.

The public availability of any source code, repository, documentation,
