   application without authorization.

l. Use the Leviathan Microsoft Entra Application ID or any other
   Leviathan-owned application registration to authenticate another
   launcher, client, service, or application.

m. Extract or attempt to obtain confidential credentials, access
   tokens, private keys, signing keys, secrets, or protected
